    "Exposed native config metadata to OptionStabilityHook on both backends and verified sequential/parallel detection",
    "MLX service metadata reports native Device and DeviceType correctly",
    "Regenerated Core ML golden reference from official v0.4.12 and source checkpoint hashes",
    "Validated three MLX checkpoints in FP32/FP16 and four existing Core ML/ANE bundles against v0.4.12",
